{
  "duration": 51.639,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.0,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.539,
      "end": 4.059,
      "text": "It's time to solve one more problem. Now in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.699,
      "end": 5.42,
      "text": "we need to find"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.92,
      "end": 8.059,
      "text": "sine square 30 degree plus cos"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.539,
      "end": 8.8,
      "text": "square"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.119,
      "end": 9.539,
      "text": "30 degree."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.939,
      "end": 12.859,
      "text": "The question also tells us to use a trigonometric identity."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.659,
      "end": 15.619,
      "text": "We know one very important identity,"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.399,
      "end": 19.479,
      "text": "sine square theta plus cos square"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.959,
      "end": 20.339,
      "text": "theta"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.799,
      "end": 21.919,
      "text": "is equal to one."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.399,
      "end": 23.299,
      "text": "Notice one thing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.799,
      "end": 24.699,
      "text": "in the identity,"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.1,
      "end": 26.199,
      "text": "the angle is theta."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.619,
      "end": 27.699,
      "text": "In our question, the angle is"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.019,
      "end": 28.579,
      "text": "30 degree."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.979,
      "end": 29.92,
      "text": "That is perfectly fine."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.439,
      "end": 33.579,
      "text": "We can simply replace theta with 30 degree."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.059,
      "end": 40.04,
      "text": "So sine square 30 degree plus cos square 30 degree becomes one."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.86,
      "end": 44.52,
      "text": "No calculation is needed because the expression exactly matches the identity."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.379,
      "end": 45.739,
      "text": "Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.159,
      "end": 51.639,
      "text": "the required answer is one. So the correct option is option C."
    }
  ],
